#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/adding-custom-css.rst:-1
msgid ""
"How to add additional CSS stylesheets or JavaScript files to your Sphinx "
"documentation to override your Sphinx theme or add interactivity with "
"JavaScript."
msgstr "如何向 Sphinx 文档添加额外的 CSS 样式表或 JavaScript 文件，以覆盖 Sphinx 主题或用 JavaScript 增加交互性。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/adding-custom-css.rst:2
msgid "How to add custom CSS or JavaScript to Sphinx documentation"
msgstr "如何为 Sphinx 文档添加自定义 CSS 或 JavaScript"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/adding-custom-css.rst:10
msgid ""
"Adding additional CSS or JavaScript files to your Sphinx documentation can "
"let you customize the look and feel of your docs or add additional "
"functionality. For example, with a small snippet of CSS, your documentation "
"could use a custom font or have a different background color."
msgstr ""
"向 Sphinx 文档添加额外的 CSS 或 JavaScript 文件，可以定制文档的观感或增加额外功能。例如，用一小段 CSS "
"就能让文档使用自定义字体或更换背景色。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/adding-custom-css.rst:16
msgid ""
"If your custom stylesheet is ``_static/css/custom.css``, you can add that "
"CSS file to the documentation using the Sphinx option `html_css_files`_::"
msgstr "若自定义样式表为 ``_static/css/custom.css`` ，可用 Sphinx 选项 `html_css_files`_ 将其加入文档::"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/adding-custom-css.rst:32
msgid "A similar approach can be used to add JavaScript files::"
msgstr "添加 JavaScript 文件可用类似方法::"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/adding-custom-css.rst:44
msgid ""
"The Sphinx HTML options ``html_css_files`` and ``html_js_files`` were added "
"in Sphinx 1.8. Unless you have a good reason to use an older version, you "
"are strongly encouraged to upgrade. Sphinx is almost entirely backwards "
"compatible."
msgstr ""
"Sphinx HTML 选项 ``html_css_files`` 和 ``html_js_files`` 在 Sphinx 1.8 "
"中加入。除非有充分理由使用旧版本，否则强烈建议升级。Sphinx 几乎完全向后兼容。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/adding-custom-css.rst:52
msgid "Overriding or replacing a theme's stylesheet"
msgstr "覆盖或替换主题样式表"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/adding-custom-css.rst:54
msgid ""
"The above approach is preferred for adding additional stylesheets or "
"JavaScript, but it is also possible to completely replace a Sphinx theme's "
"stylesheet with your own stylesheet."
msgstr "添加额外样式表或 JavaScript 时以上方式是首选，但也可以用自己的样式表完全替换 Sphinx 主题的样式表。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/adding-custom-css.rst:58
msgid ""
"If your replacement stylesheet exists at ``_static/css/yourtheme.css``, you "
"can replace your theme's CSS file by setting ``html_style`` in your "
"``conf.py``::"
msgstr ""
"若替换样式表位于 ``_static/css/yourtheme.css`` ，可在 ``conf.py`` 中设置 ``html_style`` "
"来替换主题的 CSS 文件::"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/adding-custom-css.rst:65
msgid ""
"If you only need to override a few styles on the theme, you can include the "
"theme's normal CSS using the CSS `@import rule "
"<https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@import>`_ ."
msgstr ""
"若只需覆盖主题中的少量样式，可用 CSS `@import rule <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/docs/Web/CSS/@import>`_ 引入主题的常规 CSS。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/adding-custom-css.rst:84
msgid ""
"You can also add custom classes to your html elements. See `Docutils Class "
"<https://docutils.sourceforge.io/docs/ref/rst/directives.html#class>`_ and "
"this related `Sphinx footnote... <https://www.sphinx-"
"doc.org/en/master/usage/restructuredtext/basics.html#id2>`_ for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"你还可以为 HTML 元素添加自定义类。更多信息见 `Docutils Class "
"<https://docutils.sourceforge.io/docs/ref/rst/directives.html#class>`_ 及相关的 "
"`Sphinx footnote... <https://www.sphinx-"
"doc.org/en/master/usage/restructuredtext/basics.html#id2>`_ 。"

